              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naku, mwana wa mũndũ, on’ya nyũmba ya Isilaeli ĩ nyũmba, nĩ kana masonoke nũndũ wa mothũku moo; na nĩmathime ngelekan’yo yayo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.43.10"
            ]
          }
        },
