        },
        {
          "text": "Na ambĩa, Mwana wa mũndũ, ũũ nĩw’o Mwĩaĩi Yeova ũnũkwasya: Aa nĩ motw’ĩo ma kĩthembeo mũthenya ũla makakĩseũvya, mathembe nthembo ya kũvĩvw’a ĩũlũ wakyo, na kũminzangĩsya nthakame ĩũlũ wakyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.43.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
